+# T-120: Store validation and final checkpoints
+
+**Date:** 2026-10-05 (attempt 3 revision)  
+**Scope:** store-authority validation, Acceptance persistence/import, mirror publication, and explicit task finish.
+
+## Attempt history and provenance
+
+- **Attempt 1** started under OpenCode (`zai-coding-plan:glm-5.3-flash`), was continued to implementation-complete under Codex (`gpt-6-luna`) after a session resume switched harness/model. The operator and exact time of that switch are not provable from available records; both segments were disclosed in the handoff. Attempt 1's receipt (dispatch `7524abd1-8f3e-448b-8dd7-23774fd9ebb7`/1) recorded 37 changed files; the independent review's integrity audit found 40 real changed paths plus `TASKS.md` generated noise. The three omitted files (`packages/store/src/claims.test.ts`, `dispatch.test.ts`, `history.test.ts`) were genuinely modified by attempt 1 but missed by the receipt's file enumeration — a manifest-generation failure, not an attempt to hide changes. The original receipt is preserved unmodified; this document is the factual errata.
